{"seq":21,"slug":"platform-engineering","title":"平台工程","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/platform-engineering","rating":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"平台工程\">平台工程</h1><p>当一家公司的工程师人数从几十涨到几百，每个团队都各自搭一套 CI、各自写一份 Terraform、各自摸索如何把服务部署上 Kubernetes 时，重复劳动与认知负担会以惊人的速度吞掉交付速度。平台工程就是为回应这种规模化痛点而出现的学科：它把交付软件所需的底层复杂度收拢进一个由专职团队维护、像产品一样运营的内部平台，让业务开发者通过自助方式快速、安全地构建、发布与运维。</p>\n<p>到 2026 年，平台工程已不再是新潮概念。多份行业报告显示，约八成大型工程组织建立了专职平台团队，DORA 的 2025 年度报告更指出九成组织已具备某种平台工程能力。它从一种「锦上添花」演变为现代软件交付的默认操作模型，并与 AI 辅助开发深度交织——平台底座的质量，直接决定了 AI 能在多大程度上放大组织的交付效能。</p>\n<p>本 hub 按四条主线递进展开，每一条都建立在前一条之上。</p>\n<p>第一条是<strong>基础</strong>：先讲清平台工程为何在 DevOps 之后兴起、内部开发者平台 IDP 究竟由哪些部分构成、以及「把平台当产品运营」这一根本心法。它回答的是「平台工程是什么、解决什么问题」。</p>\n<p>第二条是<strong>能力</strong>：当平台的形态确定后，要看它对外提供什么。黄金路径定义被铺好的康庄大道，自助服务与抽象决定开发者以何种接口消费平台，开发者门户 Backstage 则是这些能力的统一入口。它回答的是「平台让开发者能做什么」。</p>\n<p>第三条是<strong>运维</strong>：平台自身也是一套需要持续运行的系统。基础设施编排与 GitOps 解决「期望状态如何可靠落地」，可观测性与成本解决「平台与其上负载是否健康、是否划算」，安全合规护栏解决「如何在不挡路的前提下守住底线」。它回答的是「平台如何稳、省、安全地跑起来」。</p>\n<p>第四条是<strong>工程实践</strong>：再好的平台也要被人采纳才有价值。平台团队拓扑讲组织如何摆位、度量 DORA 与开发者体验讲如何用数据证明价值、采纳与演进讲如何让平台从试点走向全员并持续迭代。它回答的是「平台如何真正落地并长期存活」。</p>\n<p>四条主线从理念到能力、从运维到落地，构成一条完整的链路：先想明白要造什么，再造出对开发者有用的能力，把它稳健地跑起来，最后让组织真正用起来并不断改进。建议按顺序阅读，但每篇也都自成一体，可按需跳转。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/platform-engineering/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rise-of-platform-engineering","title":"平台工程的兴起","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/platform-engineering/foundations/rise-of-platform-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"internal-developer-platform","title":"内部开发者平台 IDP","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/platform-engineering/foundations/internal-developer-platform"},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-as-product","title":"平台即产品","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/platform-engineering/foundations/platform-as-product"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"capabilities","title":"能力","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/platform-engineering/capabilities","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"golden-paths","title":"黄金路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/platform-engineering/capabilities/golden-paths"},{"seq":2,"slug":"self-service-abstractions","title":"自助服务与抽象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/platform-engineering/capabilities/self-service-abstractions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"developer-portal-backstage","title":"开发者门户 Backstage","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/platform-engineering/capabilities/developer-portal-backstage"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"operations","title":"运维","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/platform-engineering/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"infrastructure-orchestration-gitops","title":"基础设施编排与 GitOps","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/platform-engineering/operations/infrastructure-orchestration-gitops"},{"seq":2,"slug":"observability-and-cost","title":"可观测性与成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/platform-engineering/operations/observability-and-cost"},{"seq":3,"slug":"security-compliance-guardrails","title":"安全合规护栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/platform-engineering/operations/security-compliance-guardrails"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/platform-engineering/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-team-topologies","title":"平台团队拓扑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/platform-engineering/practice/platform-team-topologies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"metrics-dora-dx","title":"度量 DORA 与开发者体验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/platform-engineering/practice/metrics-dora-dx"},{"seq":3,"slug":"adoption-evolution","title":"采纳与演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/platform-engineering/practice/adoption-evolution"}]}]}